    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Data stored here are presented within the manuscript entitled \"Arsenic release metabolically constrained to permanently saturated soils in Mekong Delta\" authored by Jason W. Stuckey, Michael V. Schaefer, Benjamin D. Kocar, Shawn G. Benner, and Scott Fendorf published within Nature Geosciences.  Details on the methods can be found within the article.  Included here are data from the various field and laboratory experiments and field characteristics:  (a) Laboratory incubation (and amendment) of fresh field soils and sediments, (b) In-well incubations, (c)Permanent Wetland formation, (d) X-ray diffraction spectra of sediments.",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        },
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Stuckey, J.W., M.V. Schaefer, B.D. Kocar, S.G. Benner, and S. Fendorf. (2015). Supporting data for the paper \"Arsenic release metabolically constrained to permanently saturated soils in Mekong Delta\". Stanford Digital Repository. Available at: http://purl.stanford.edu/hg543pc2107",
